app.S2xhdml5bw.type.YWN0aW9uOlkzSmxZWFJs.source:
Operators for phone string array filters.

Example condition using this filter:
        {
            "type": "profile-property",
            "field": "phone",
            "filter": {
                "type": "string",
                "operator": "phone-country-code-in",
                "value": ["US", "GB"]
            }
        }

